WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.700
Specs in, signed receipts out.

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:07.550
A spec sentence decomposes into a tree of concerns.

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:13.850
Each task compiles into a bundle under twenty-five thousand six hundred bytes.

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:19.325
A leased worktree isolates the build. Four gates wait.

00:00:20.525 --> 00:00:25.575
Ruff, mypy, pytest, mutmut. Mechanical, deterministic, appeal-free.

00:00:26.775 --> 00:00:31.650
Passing gates mint a signed receipt: commit hash, timings, violations.

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:37.075
A blind judge audits the diff without knowing the author.

00:00:38.275 --> 00:00:42.925
Merge only when the receipt verifies. Sovereign, never automatic.

00:00:44.125 --> 00:00:48.800
No zero-defect claims. The pilot tied one to one, for four cents.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:54.625
Specs in, signed receipts out.  Run the pipeline.
